<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Danny</Major>
    <Description>Anti Afk macro
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This macro is so that the minecraft servers don't kick you for being afk
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bind a key with this macro and press it to scroll the mouse in your inventory
and so the server intuits that you arent AFK, 
when you want to stop the macro press the same key again.</Description>
    <Comment>Thank you for download the macro :)</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>WheelUp 1
Delay 1 s</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>